WEBVTT

00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:48.610
Sigh, I'm in math now!

00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:49.940
It's over!
That test was hard.
How's life at your school, Suzu?

00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:49.940
Yeah, I just finished my test, too!
I don't think it went well...
What're you doing after this?

00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:49.940
About to head to practice!
It's hot today,
so it's gonna be really bad!

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:56.240
Chi-chan, hang in there!

00:00:55.570 --> 00:00:57.440
Suzuko, we're ready.

00:00:57.440 --> 00:00:58.710
Let's go home!

00:00:58.710 --> 00:00:59.600
Okay.

00:01:00.410 --> 00:01:02.340
The thing in third period today...

00:01:02.340 --> 00:01:03.190
I know!

00:01:03.190 --> 00:01:04.630
Wasn't it hilarious?

00:01:08.940 --> 00:01:10.560
Who is it? Your boyfriend?

00:01:10.560 --> 00:01:12.930
No, it's my dad.

00:01:12.930 --> 00:01:15.260
He says he wants Japanese cooking for dinner.

00:01:15.260 --> 00:01:17.630
Wow, he tells you what he wants, huh?

00:01:17.630 --> 00:01:19.390
You two are so close.

00:01:24.680 --> 00:01:26.940
Homura Suzuko-san.

00:01:28.480 --> 00:01:29.610
Yes?

00:01:31.860 --> 00:01:33.580
Um...

00:01:34.700 --> 00:01:37.280
Okay, Suzuko, see you later.

00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:38.620
See you tomorrow.

00:01:38.620 --> 00:01:40.850
Yeah, see you.

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:49.500
Um...

00:01:49.960 --> 00:01:51.510
Homura Suzuko-san.

00:01:53.240 --> 00:01:56.010
Want to do it with me?

00:02:13.100 --> 00:02:18.220
U-Um... How did you know who I was?

00:02:18.220 --> 00:02:19.530
Mizushima Kiyoi.

00:02:19.900 --> 00:02:22.120
I was a Selector, like you.

00:02:23.640 --> 00:02:26.330
I want to see your power.

00:02:26.840 --> 00:02:28.020
Power...

00:02:31.790 --> 00:02:33.590
Summon Valkyrie Argos.

00:02:33.940 --> 00:02:36.420
Ener Charge Argos's ability.

00:02:36.420 --> 00:02:38.590
Activate spell "Innocent Jeweled Blade."

00:02:38.590 --> 00:02:40.390
Attack, and turn end.

00:02:40.390 --> 00:02:41.240
Grow.

00:02:41.240 --> 00:02:43.480
Summon Aztec and place Voyni on the field.

00:02:43.480 --> 00:02:45.150
ARTS: Death Colossao.

00:02:45.150 --> 00:02:46.930
Banish all your SIGNI.

00:02:49.660 --> 00:02:51.050
You're good.

00:02:51.050 --> 00:02:52.080
You think so?

00:02:52.080 --> 00:02:53.080
I do.

00:02:53.080 --> 00:02:55.460
But I couldn't beat that man.

00:02:57.310 --> 00:02:58.570
Satomi Kou.

00:03:10.170 --> 00:03:13.230
You defeated him and took back your memories,

00:03:13.230 --> 00:03:14.540
then you left the battle.

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:16.050
Right?

00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:19.130
Tell me about your battle with Satomi.

00:03:21.570 --> 00:03:24.010
I was so desperate...

00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:27.810
I told myself I had to protect Chi-chan.

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:32.830
Now, it's time for the finale.

00:03:32.830 --> 00:03:34.520
End it, Carnival.

00:03:34.810 --> 00:03:38.360
You're sure you want me 
to crush your toy, Kou?

00:03:38.680 --> 00:03:39.860
Suzu!

00:03:40.580 --> 00:03:41.360
Chi-chan?

00:03:41.990 --> 00:03:43.160
Use this!

00:03:46.130 --> 00:03:47.150
You can do it.

00:03:49.730 --> 00:03:50.620
Right.

00:03:51.380 --> 00:03:52.780
Coin bet!

00:03:54.880 --> 00:03:56.060
Requiem.

00:03:57.290 --> 00:03:59.000
Wh-What?

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:08.390
Just...

00:04:12.440 --> 00:04:14.580
die already!

00:04:16.220 --> 00:04:17.400
<i>Riru won't lose.</i>

00:04:18.500 --> 00:04:19.370
<i>We won't lose.</i>

00:04:19.740 --> 00:04:21.260
<i>If the two of us are together!</i>

00:04:37.720 --> 00:04:39.960
The darkness doesn't end.

00:04:45.380 --> 00:04:47.470
Yes. It wasn't going to end.

00:04:54.240 --> 00:04:56.270
Each time you lose a battle,

00:04:56.270 --> 00:04:58.370
each time the time limit comes,

00:04:58.370 --> 00:05:00.440
you lose one of your precious memories.

00:05:01.160 --> 00:05:04.950
You suffer, you tremble at 
the fear of ceasing to exist...

00:05:05.470 --> 00:05:07.590
The despair increases.

00:05:07.590 --> 00:05:10.970
It takes physical form, 
and a new LRIG is born.

00:05:17.310 --> 00:05:20.070
The battles will begin again. I know it.

00:05:20.070 --> 00:05:21.140
No...

00:05:21.140 --> 00:05:21.750
Grow.

00:05:22.180 --> 00:05:24.050
The effect sends one card to the trash.

00:05:24.050 --> 00:05:25.670
Attack with SIGNI.

00:05:25.670 --> 00:05:26.890
Turn end.

00:05:28.210 --> 00:05:31.890
You didn't really think 
it was all over, did you?

00:05:32.400 --> 00:05:35.520
I... I don't know.

00:05:35.950 --> 00:05:36.860
But...

00:05:37.730 --> 00:05:38.600
But?

00:05:39.550 --> 00:05:44.140
I don't want to think about 
that happening again...

00:05:45.470 --> 00:05:47.070
Is that what you really think?

00:05:47.800 --> 00:05:52.630
You could've refused when 
I invited you to play WIXOSS.

00:05:52.630 --> 00:05:54.760
When I told you I was a Selector.

00:05:55.480 --> 00:05:57.840
If you really never wanted 
to do this again...

00:05:57.840 --> 00:05:59.020
I...

00:05:59.020 --> 00:06:02.280
Are you still thinking about it? 
Telling yourself it can't be over yet?

00:06:02.280 --> 00:06:02.960
No.

00:06:03.220 --> 00:06:05.850
Do you want to fight more battles? Or...

00:06:05.850 --> 00:06:06.800
No!

00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:07.420
Grow!

00:06:07.420 --> 00:06:09.010
Summon two SIGNI.

00:06:09.010 --> 00:06:10.520
ARTS: Stole Story.

00:06:10.520 --> 00:06:12.220
I steal your Death Collosao 
and active its effect.

00:06:12.220 --> 00:06:14.300
Then summon SIGNI.

00:06:14.300 --> 00:06:16.950
And... attack.

00:06:18.660 --> 00:06:20.160
Just what I should've expected.

00:06:22.480 --> 00:06:25.360
Homura Suzuko-san, I want your help.

00:06:26.750 --> 00:06:29.150
I want to end the cycle of darkness.

00:06:29.150 --> 00:06:31.580
I need powerful Selectors.

00:06:33.980 --> 00:06:36.490
But I...

00:06:36.490 --> 00:06:37.870
"I'm done with it."

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:40.960
If that's what you think, 
then I won't force you.

00:06:41.510 --> 00:06:43.460
But if that's not true...

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:46.510
Contact me.

00:06:55.900 --> 00:06:57.060
Yeah, this is great.

00:06:57.630 --> 00:06:59.390
You're getting better at cooking.

00:07:01.420 --> 00:07:02.820
Suzuko? What's wrong?

00:07:02.820 --> 00:07:04.360
Nothing.

00:07:13.080 --> 00:07:14.700
Is basketball practice tough?

00:07:14.920 --> 00:07:17.440
Yeah, I joined partway through year two,

00:07:17.440 --> 00:07:19.760
so I'm below even the first-year students.

00:07:19.760 --> 00:07:22.240
I have to do all the grunt work.

00:07:22.240 --> 00:07:23.830
That sounds rough.

00:07:24.440 --> 00:07:27.610
But when we're playing a game, 
I get really fired up.

00:07:27.610 --> 00:07:31.510
I yell at the players, 
"What are you doing? Run faster!"

00:07:31.510 --> 00:07:32.770
Scary!

00:07:35.520 --> 00:07:39.120
You were like that during dodgeball 
in elementary school, too.

00:07:41.550 --> 00:07:42.480
I'm sorry.

00:07:42.480 --> 00:07:43.420
It's okay.

00:07:43.980 --> 00:07:45.300
Oh, right.

00:07:46.630 --> 00:07:49.400
Look, this movie's coming out next month.

00:07:49.400 --> 00:07:51.290
That looks interesting.

00:07:51.290 --> 00:07:53.950
But will it be crowded on the first day?

00:08:04.310 --> 00:08:08.000
<i>If there's anything I can do...</i>

00:08:18.320 --> 00:08:19.930
Mizushima-san!

00:08:20.360 --> 00:08:22.160
Sorry! Did I keep you waiting?

00:08:22.160 --> 00:08:24.220
No. Let's go.

00:08:24.220 --> 00:08:25.020
Wait.

00:08:25.460 --> 00:08:28.200
Another friend of mine is coming.

00:08:29.160 --> 00:08:30.490
Friend?

00:08:30.490 --> 00:08:32.320
A girl from my school.

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:36.530
She's really good at WIXOSS and can help 
with a lot of things, so I asked her.

00:08:36.530 --> 00:08:39.120
Homura-san, do you know 
what we're doing today?

00:08:39.440 --> 00:08:40.230
Yes.

00:08:40.230 --> 00:08:44.080
Satomi-san... or rather, 
it's an LRIG that's inside him now.

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:46.420
But we're going to find him, right?

00:08:46.720 --> 00:08:50.170
We don't know where he is or what he's doing.

00:08:50.170 --> 00:08:53.510
There's a chance that he's up to 
no good and waiting to ambush us.

00:08:53.510 --> 00:08:55.000
This isn't a game.

00:08:55.000 --> 00:08:57.010
I'm sorry, I didn't mean...

00:08:57.280 --> 00:08:59.820
I don't know who you asked to come, but...

00:08:59.820 --> 00:09:00.800
Acceptance.

00:09:00.800 --> 00:09:02.040
So it was you?

00:09:06.880 --> 00:09:08.370
It's been a long time.

00:09:10.200 --> 00:09:11.530
It has.

00:09:12.300 --> 00:09:14.200
Huh? You know her?

00:09:14.200 --> 00:09:15.050
Connection.

00:09:15.050 --> 00:09:17.940
We met as Selectors and fought.

00:09:17.940 --> 00:09:19.870
I was thoroughly defeated.

00:09:20.920 --> 00:09:22.120
You lost, Hanna-chan?

00:09:22.550 --> 00:09:24.910
She really is strong.

00:09:24.910 --> 00:09:25.910
Lucky.

00:09:25.910 --> 00:09:27.710
I was hoping to see you again.

00:09:28.240 --> 00:09:30.090
I wanted a chance to play you again.

00:09:30.640 --> 00:09:32.300
I'm always willing.

00:09:33.750 --> 00:09:35.160
U-Um...

00:09:36.720 --> 00:09:38.340
I made cookies!

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:40.360
Want some?

00:09:42.700 --> 00:09:44.080
Exhaustion.

00:09:44.080 --> 00:09:46.430
You're acting like we're going on a field trip.

00:09:46.430 --> 00:09:48.060
Am I?

00:09:51.310 --> 00:09:52.110
Stable.

00:09:52.110 --> 00:09:53.550
Chocolate chip and banana.

00:09:53.550 --> 00:09:55.540
The same as your usual.

00:09:56.080 --> 00:09:57.860
Try some.

00:09:58.660 --> 00:10:01.530
It's better than you'll find at most stores.

00:10:06.230 --> 00:10:07.040
It's good.

00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:13.000
Unfair!

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:14.800
Are you going to eat them all yourself?

00:10:14.800 --> 00:10:16.920
It was your suggestion.

00:10:16.920 --> 00:10:19.470
There's plenty more!

00:10:20.360 --> 00:10:23.430
If Satomi-san... er, what used to be Satomi-san?

00:10:23.430 --> 00:10:24.550
Complex.

00:10:24.550 --> 00:10:26.290
Let's just call him Carnival.

00:10:26.290 --> 00:10:28.730
It's Carnival that's inside him now.

00:10:29.200 --> 00:10:30.490
Yeah...

00:10:30.490 --> 00:10:34.300
If Carnival is trying to get 
involved in the battles again...

00:10:34.300 --> 00:10:37.460
We need to be chosen as Selectors again.

00:10:37.460 --> 00:10:38.150
Inevitable.

00:10:38.520 --> 00:10:41.760
He should be going in and 
out of card shops a lot.

00:10:41.760 --> 00:10:46.160
And listening to people on the street and 
reading the Internet to gather information.

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:56.550
Satomi once used this bar as his base 
when he was the bookmaker.

00:10:56.550 --> 00:11:01.010
But he hasn't come here once 
since the battles ended.

00:11:01.600 --> 00:11:05.640
He used two people who'd been 
inhabited by LRIGs as his servants.

00:11:06.190 --> 00:11:09.140
Sumida Sou and Narumi Shou.

00:11:09.140 --> 00:11:11.730
We don't know where they are, either.

00:11:12.600 --> 00:11:14.000
Narumi-san...

00:11:16.150 --> 00:11:20.080
Are there a lot of people who've 
changed places with LRIGs?

00:11:21.780 --> 00:11:22.660
Question.

00:11:23.890 --> 00:11:25.430
Why are you so intent

00:11:25.430 --> 00:11:29.400
on unraveling the mysteries of the Selector battles, Mizushima-san?

00:11:29.400 --> 00:11:30.930
Two reasons.

00:11:30.930 --> 00:11:36.280
One is that I lost some of my memories 
in the last round of battles.

00:11:38.260 --> 00:11:41.760
Very, very important ones...

00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:46.220
Green Tea

00:11:43.180 --> 00:11:46.220
I'm going to get them 
back in the next battle.

00:11:46.840 --> 00:11:48.310
Warning.

00:11:48.310 --> 00:11:53.350
Getting all your memories back 
doesn't always lead to happiness.

00:11:53.780 --> 00:11:55.360
Hanna-chan...

00:11:55.360 --> 00:11:56.660
True.

00:11:56.660 --> 00:12:01.030
But no matter what kind of memories 
they are, they're a part of me.

00:12:01.370 --> 00:12:03.990
That means I'm not the real me right now.

00:12:04.970 --> 00:12:06.490
The real...

00:12:09.450 --> 00:12:14.420
The other reason is that I have a 
responsibility to stop the Selector battles.

00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:15.570
Responsibility?

00:12:15.570 --> 00:12:19.250
In the first Selector battles, I was an LRIG.

00:12:20.180 --> 00:12:21.510
An LRIG?

00:12:21.510 --> 00:12:26.080
The first battles... The ones 
created by the girl called Mayu?

00:12:26.080 --> 00:12:27.090
Yes.

00:12:27.090 --> 00:12:34.050
I've met that girl, Mayu, 
many times in that white room...

00:12:34.690 --> 00:12:36.830
This is her game.

00:12:36.830 --> 00:12:40.730
I was her toy. She was merely playing with me.

00:12:41.440 --> 00:12:43.450
But that didn't bother me.

00:12:43.820 --> 00:12:46.610
I intended to use her, too.

00:12:47.630 --> 00:12:53.460
I annihilated the girls I faced in 
battle as a way to get my revenge.

00:12:54.510 --> 00:12:57.620
Sometimes even the Selectors who owned me...

00:13:00.010 --> 00:13:04.930
The "first LRIGs" were born from 
the sorrows of young girls...

00:13:04.930 --> 00:13:09.790
And I'm sure some of those 
sorrows were created by me.

00:13:13.770 --> 00:13:14.540
So...

00:13:14.540 --> 00:13:15.850
I don't think it's your fault.

00:13:16.870 --> 00:13:22.170
Anyone who gets caught up in these awful 
battles can only care about themselves...

00:13:22.170 --> 00:13:24.970
So it's not your fault, Kiyoi-chan!

00:13:27.050 --> 00:13:28.000
Kiyoi-chan?

00:13:28.000 --> 00:13:30.820
Oh... S-Sorry! I wasn't thinking...

00:13:30.820 --> 00:13:34.380
But you can call me Suzuko.

00:13:38.010 --> 00:13:40.840
Thank you, Suzuko.

00:13:40.840 --> 00:13:42.390
Sure, Kiyoi-cha—

00:13:42.390 --> 00:13:44.600
Can I call you Ki-chan?

00:13:44.600 --> 00:13:45.640
Hasty.

00:13:45.640 --> 00:13:48.580
Suzuko-san, don't you think 
you're moving a little too fast?

00:13:49.440 --> 00:13:50.280
Sorry.

00:13:50.280 --> 00:13:52.600
I'll just call you Kiyoi-chan.

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:56.020
If you really don't like it, 
then never mind, I guess...

00:13:58.730 --> 00:13:59.770
Doubt.

00:13:59.770 --> 00:14:02.730
Is there any point in 
following the former LRIGs?

00:14:03.130 --> 00:14:05.240
Once they have a human body,

00:14:05.240 --> 00:14:08.970
isn't the only thing left for 
them to accept their new lives?

00:14:08.970 --> 00:14:10.400
I can feel it...

00:14:10.400 --> 00:14:15.450
It feels like the LRIGs are slowly 
evolving into something dangerous.

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:21.880
Oh, no... What do I do?

00:14:21.880 --> 00:14:26.270
Six months ago, I battled 
with a girl I met by chance.

00:14:26.270 --> 00:14:27.980
Piruluk, attack.

00:14:29.020 --> 00:14:31.470
She had one coin left.

00:14:32.770 --> 00:14:33.890
I'm going to lose.

00:14:33.890 --> 00:14:34.720
What do I do?

00:14:34.720 --> 00:14:36.100
Turn end.

00:14:36.100 --> 00:14:38.890
My goal was to find Satomi.

00:14:39.320 --> 00:14:42.110
I was going to just let her win soon, when...

00:14:40.890 --> 00:14:42.110
Oh, no!

00:14:43.320 --> 00:14:46.600
Listen, you're seriously about to disappear.

00:14:46.600 --> 00:14:47.950
Forever.

00:14:47.950 --> 00:14:49.740
Stop hiding how you really feel.

00:14:49.740 --> 00:14:52.810
You wanna just die while
others treat you like scum?

00:14:52.810 --> 00:14:54.910
It's the people around you 
who are to blame, right?

00:14:54.910 --> 00:14:57.250
You're always saying it on the inside...

00:14:57.720 --> 00:14:59.710
"I wish they'd just all disappear."

00:14:59.710 --> 00:15:06.550
Let all the black, painful stuff 
deep inside you spill out.

00:15:06.550 --> 00:15:10.260
Let it spill out all over 
the trash in the world!

00:15:11.820 --> 00:15:12.750
Why?

00:15:13.940 --> 00:15:15.640
Why is it always me?

00:15:16.280 --> 00:15:17.860
...sappear.

00:15:17.860 --> 00:15:19.810
All of you, disappear!

00:15:19.810 --> 00:15:23.650
That's right! That's right, 
let it all spill out!

00:15:24.930 --> 00:15:26.840
Leyra, grow.

00:15:27.530 --> 00:15:29.150
Coin bet.

00:15:29.150 --> 00:15:30.110
Doping!

00:15:37.160 --> 00:15:38.540
Do it!

00:15:53.890 --> 00:15:56.720
<i>Her damage output increased, 
but she's taking damage, too?</i>

00:15:56.720 --> 00:15:58.350
More! More!

00:16:00.270 --> 00:16:01.350
<i>Piruluk...</i>

00:16:01.350 --> 00:16:04.600
Just disappear... All of you, just disappear!

00:16:05.360 --> 00:16:07.230
You're a good girl!

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:22.540
Huh?

00:16:23.020 --> 00:16:24.070
Why?

00:16:25.930 --> 00:16:28.210
That's right...

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:32.220
Leyra... Why? No... I'm going to dis—

00:16:44.520 --> 00:16:46.190
It feels great.

00:16:46.620 --> 00:16:50.570
She was a disgusting woman, 
perfect for the battles.

00:16:51.450 --> 00:16:53.400
Bye-bye!

00:16:53.400 --> 00:16:57.660
That LRIG was clearly in 
control of the girl's heart.

00:16:58.270 --> 00:17:00.840
If their goal isn't just 
luring them into battles,

00:17:00.840 --> 00:17:04.520
but awakening the evil that's 
deep within their hearts

00:17:04.520 --> 00:17:06.920
and making it into their own power...

00:17:06.920 --> 00:17:07.670
Doubt!

00:17:07.670 --> 00:17:10.460
I can see no point in LRIGs doing that.

00:17:11.060 --> 00:17:13.840
I'm just afraid of the worst possibility.

00:17:14.740 --> 00:17:19.800
If evil LRIGs like Satomi start to 
increase their numbers and come together,

00:17:19.800 --> 00:17:21.850
they'll devour this world.

00:17:21.850 --> 00:17:22.540
Doubt.

00:17:22.540 --> 00:17:24.180
I think that's taking it a bit far.

00:17:24.580 --> 00:17:26.900
You won't know what an LRIG really thinks

00:17:26.900 --> 00:17:29.810
after it's taken over a human 
until you see for yourself.

00:17:29.810 --> 00:17:30.780
Suggestion.

00:17:30.780 --> 00:17:32.530
Someone comes to mind.

00:17:35.030 --> 00:17:38.270
That's right. We know Shirai-san... Donor-san.

00:17:38.270 --> 00:17:39.160
Excitement.

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:41.740
I was right to ask how to contact him.

00:17:42.690 --> 00:17:45.710
I don't know anything about the other LRIGs.

00:17:46.420 --> 00:17:50.210
Honestly, lately I find myself 
forgetting that I was an LRIG.

00:17:50.960 --> 00:17:55.030
All the memories of Shirai 
Shouhei are still inside me.

00:17:55.030 --> 00:17:57.430
Everyone around me treats me like him.

00:17:57.910 --> 00:18:01.720
And it kind of feels like I've 
spent my whole life in this body.

00:18:02.400 --> 00:18:06.020
But at times, I desperately
want to fight a battle.

00:18:06.890 --> 00:18:09.270
A LRIG instinct, perhaps?

00:18:10.230 --> 00:18:12.730
When it happens, I get scared of myself.

00:18:13.940 --> 00:18:17.430
Can you sense what Carnival 
or the other LRIGs are doing?

00:18:17.430 --> 00:18:18.600
Nope.

00:18:18.600 --> 00:18:22.660
But I can't see her just doing nothing.

00:18:23.090 --> 00:18:26.270
It feels like I'm really talking to Shirai-san.

00:18:26.270 --> 00:18:27.800
You sound like a boy.

00:18:28.310 --> 00:18:31.000
When I was an LRIG, I was pretty tomboyish.

00:18:31.000 --> 00:18:32.930
Shou-chan used to pick on me for it.

00:18:35.330 --> 00:18:38.660
Hey, that girl... Morikawa Chinatsu.

00:18:38.660 --> 00:18:40.410
Does she remember Shou-chan?

00:18:42.840 --> 00:18:45.110
I see... Yeah, of course.

00:18:46.980 --> 00:18:49.180
Will you stay out of them from now on?

00:18:50.210 --> 00:18:51.440
The Selector battles.

00:18:51.900 --> 00:18:54.900
Shou-chan lost his life protecting her.

00:18:55.220 --> 00:18:56.990
Morikawa Chinatsu, and you, too...

00:18:56.990 --> 00:19:00.580
I never want you to get close 
to that darkness again!

00:19:07.580 --> 00:19:10.460
Kiyoi-chan, listen... I...

00:19:20.300 --> 00:19:21.730
Carnival!

00:19:21.730 --> 00:19:22.840
Kiyoi-chan!

00:19:23.440 --> 00:19:24.180
Excuse me!

00:19:27.820 --> 00:19:28.760
Let's split up.

00:19:28.760 --> 00:19:29.930
Roger!

00:19:28.760 --> 00:19:29.930
Okay!

00:19:41.400 --> 00:19:43.160
I-I'm sorry!

00:19:50.640 --> 00:19:53.860
<i>Now, let's begin again...</i>

00:20:06.360 --> 00:20:09.140
Was I mistaken?

00:20:09.790 --> 00:20:11.740
I guess that's it for today.

00:20:11.740 --> 00:20:12.680
Confirmation.

00:20:12.680 --> 00:20:16.910
Are you going to continue chasing after 
the darkness of the Selector battles?

00:20:16.910 --> 00:20:17.630
Yes.

00:20:17.630 --> 00:20:18.900
Suzuko-san?

00:20:20.010 --> 00:20:21.170
I...

00:20:21.610 --> 00:20:23.610
Warning. Shouldn't you give it more thought?

00:20:24.050 --> 00:20:28.830
Remember all the things those horrible 
days took from you and Chinatsu-san,

00:20:28.830 --> 00:20:31.250
and how dangerous it is to return to them.

00:20:32.030 --> 00:20:34.420
Don't you owe it to Shirai-san?

00:20:38.200 --> 00:20:41.240
Kiyoi-chan, I'm sorry.

00:20:41.240 --> 00:20:42.970
I can't help after all.

00:20:43.640 --> 00:20:48.010
I decided I'd follow a 
new path with Chi-chan.

00:20:50.240 --> 00:20:51.610
All right.

00:20:51.610 --> 00:20:54.190
But, Suzuko...

00:20:54.810 --> 00:20:56.940
You're still uncertain.

00:20:59.840 --> 00:21:00.890
See you later.

00:21:07.920 --> 00:21:09.410
Sorry, Suzu.

00:21:09.410 --> 00:21:10.080
Did you wait long?

00:21:10.080 --> 00:21:11.120
No.

00:21:13.540 --> 00:21:14.660
No.

00:21:17.320 --> 00:21:18.800
What's wrong, Suzu?

00:21:18.800 --> 00:21:21.350
It's nothing. Let's go, Chi-chan.

00:21:26.380 --> 00:21:27.800
<i>I'm not...</i>

00:21:30.610 --> 00:21:31.770
<i>going back.</i>

00:21:40.950 --> 00:21:42.440
Hello,

00:21:45.910 --> 00:21:47.490
Kominato Ruuko-san.

00:21:52.950 --> 00:21:55.960
Omen / Daybreak and Dawn
